{"seq":3,"slug":"resolver-failure-modes-algorithm-rollover","title":"解析器算法支持、密钥轮转失败模式与故障定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/resolver-validation-recursive/resolver-failure-modes-algorithm-rollover","wordCount":2806,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"解析器算法支持-密钥轮转失败模式与故障定位\">解析器算法支持、密钥轮转失败模式与故障定位</h1><p>一次 KSK 轮转在权威侧&quot;看起来做完了&quot;，在解析器侧却可能已经静默降级了整整一天——因为算法协商和密钥匹配是两件独立的事，而最终用户拿到的仍然是一条 200 OK 的答案。DNSSEC 运维里最难定位的故障不是 SERVFAIL，恰恰是<strong>不报错的故障</strong>：验证器把区带当成未签名处理，AD 位置 0，答案照常返回。要抓住它，必须先理解验证器的算法支持面、轮转的时序常数，以及如何把 EDE 信息码还原成具体的钥或签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个必须先分清的对象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>算法支持面</strong>：验证器认识哪些算法号与摘要类型，边界由 IANA 注册表 + RFC 8624 分级决定，而非代码里写死的清单。</li>\n<li><strong>轮转时序常数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>pub</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{pub}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{obs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这类由传播延迟与 TTL 相加得到的最短安全窗口，错一个就会漏签或提前撤钥。</li>\n<li><strong>失败指纹</strong>：EDE 信息码 + AD 位命中率组成的可观测信号，把&quot;哪里坏了&quot;从猜测变成可分类的读数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"算法协商先于密钥匹配-降级语义的三种出口\">算法协商先于密钥匹配：降级语义的三种出口</h2><p>RFC 4035 §4.3 定义的四态里，算法不匹配的落点取决于它在链条哪一环被触发，出口完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>第一环：DS 里的算法/摘要不受支持。</strong> RFC 6840 §5.2 规定：验证器如果<strong>不支持 DS RRset 中列出的任一算法</strong>，就&quot;应当把子区当作未签名处理&quot;。这是整条规则里最危险的一句——它把&quot;我的验证器太旧&quot;伪装成&quot;这个区本来就没签名&quot;。RFC 4035 §5.2 的同源条款要求验证器在构造信任链时忽略自己不支持的 DS，只有当<strong>所有</strong> DS 都被忽略后才降级为 Insecure。因此 2026 年部署一个新算法时，如果校方只发布<em>单一</em>新算法的 DS 而没有并存的旧算法 DS，老版本解析器会静默地给 Insecure，而不是报警。</p>\n<p><strong>第二环：DNSKEY 算法不受支持。</strong> 若 DS 支持的算法通过了协商，但区带时 DNSKEY RRset 里就是不认识那个算法号，验证器无法完成验签，返回 Bogus 并携带 EDE 信息码 <strong>1（Unsupported DNSKEY Algorithm）</strong>。这是&quot;能报错的那一版&quot;，和第一环形成对照：同一份配置失误，出现在 DS 侧就是静默 Insecure，出现在 DNSKEY 侧才是可见的 Bogus。</p>\n<p><strong>第三环：摘要类型不受支持。</strong> DS 记录的摘要类型（digest type）走独立演进的注册表，SHA-1 已被 RFC 8624 标为弃用——不再用于生成新 DS，验证侧的支持也在退场。摘要不受支持时的 EDE 码是 <strong>2（Unsupported DS Digest Type）</strong>。两环合起来构成算法轮转的头号拦路虎：新算法与 SHA-1 弃用同时推进时，任何一侧落在旧验证器上都可能是静默降级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发位置</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>是否可见</th>\n<th>EDE 码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DS 全部算法不受支持</td>\n<td>按未签名处理</td>\n<td>否（AD=0，无报错）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNSKEY 算法号不认识</td>\n<td>Bogus / SERVFAIL</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DS 摘要类型不认识</td>\n<td>Bogus / SERVFAIL</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NSEC3 迭代次数超策略</td>\n<td>Bogus（部分验证器）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>27</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"验证器的算法支持面-注册表与-rfc-8624-分级\">验证器的算法支持面：注册表与 RFC 8624 分级</h2><p>验证器的能力边界不在代码里，而在 IANA 的 <strong>DNSSEC Algorithm Numbers</strong> 与 <strong>DS RR Type Digest Algorithms</strong> 两张注册表上。算法号是 8 位整数：<code>5</code>/<code>7</code> 是 RSASHA1 系列（旧），<code>8</code> 是 RSASHA256（仍是当下主力），<code>13</code> 是 ECDSAP256SHA256（推荐签名算法），<code>15</code> 是 ED25519，<code>16</code> 是 ED448，<code>12</code>/<code>23</code> 是 GOST 系（已弃用）。摘要类型里 <code>1</code> 是 SHA-1、<code>2</code> 是 SHA-256、<code>4</code> 是 SHA-384。</p>\n<p>RFC 8624（2019）是这些号码的<strong>实施与使用建议</strong>权威表，RFC 9157（2021）修订了其中的 IANA 登记细节。它的分级直接决定轮转策略：<code>8</code> 与 <code>13</code> 是 MUST（必须支持验证、推荐用于签名），<code>15</code> 是 RECOMMENDED，<code>14</code>/<code>16</code> 是 MAY，而 <code>1</code>/<code>3</code>/<code>5</code>/<code>7</code>/<code>12</code> 已跌落为 MUST NOT 或仅供遗留验证。<strong>签名方与验证方的版本差就是事故面</strong>：校方按 RFC 8624 换到 ED25519，而网络里仍有解析器只认 RSASHA256，中间那段时间就是验证分叉窗口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[区带发布新算法密钥] --&gt; B{父区 DS 是否同时含新旧算法?}&#10;  B --&gt;|只含新算法| C[老验证器: 全部 DS 被忽略&lt;br/&gt;静默 Insecure AD=0]&#10;  B --&gt;|新旧并存| D{解析器是否支持新算法?}&#10;  D --&gt;|支持| E[验签通过 Secure]&#10;  D --&gt;|不支持| F[退回旧算法继续验签&lt;br/&gt;轮转平滑]&#10;  C --&gt; G[无报错, 显式监控 AD 命中率才能发现]\">graph TD\n  A[区带发布新算法密钥] --&gt; B{父区 DS 是否同时含新旧算法?}\n  B --&gt;|只含新算法| C[老验证器: 全部 DS 被忽略&lt;br/&gt;静默 Insecure AD=0]\n  B --&gt;|新旧并存| D{解析器是否支持新算法?}\n  D --&gt;|支持| E[验签通过 Secure]\n  D --&gt;|不支持| F[退回旧算法继续验签&lt;br/&gt;轮转平滑]\n  C --&gt; G[无报错, 显式监控 AD 命中率才能发现]</pre><p>这张图解释了为什么<strong>算法轮转必须走&quot;新旧并存&quot;而非替换</strong>：先用旧算法发布新算法的密钥并双签，等所有解析器都学会新算法，再撤旧算法。任何一步把并存窗口缩到零，都会把&quot;版本落后的解析器&quot;变成&quot;静默放行的解析器&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"密钥轮转的时序模型-常数错了就会漏签\">密钥轮转的时序模型：常数错了就会漏签</h2><p>轮转的每一步都受&quot;传播延迟 + TTL&quot;封顶，RFC 6781 定义了流程，RFC 7583 给出了常数公式。以 KSK 轮转为例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>pub</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>DNSKEY</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{pub}} = D_{\\text{prp}} + TTL_{\\text{DNSKEY}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DNSKEY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>DS</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{obs}} = D_{\\text{prp}} + TTL_{\\text{DS}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{prp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;一次变更从签发到全网上游都刷到&quot;的传播延迟。直觉：新 DNSKEY 必须至少存活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>pub</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{pub}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才允许父区发布指向它的 DS，否则解析器可能先看到 DS、却还查不到对应公钥；旧 DS 必须再存活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{obs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才允许撤除，否则缓存里还有旧 DS 的解析器会发现它指向的公钥已消失。<strong>签名有效期还必须覆盖整个窗口</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>expiration</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>pub</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{expiration}} \\ge t_{\\text{now}} + I_{\\text{pub}} + I_{\\text{obs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiration</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的叠加余量——把 TTL 调大而不同步拉长签名有效期，是轮转期间 EDE 7 激增的标准成因。</p>\n<p>KSK 与 ZSK 的观察期常数不同：ZSK 撤除只需等 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>RRSIG</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{prp}} + TTL_{\\text{RRSIG}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RRSIG</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因为它不在父区出现，省掉了 DS 那一跳；KSK 则必须等 DS 的 TTL。这解释了为什么&quot;ZSK 轮转又快又便宜、KSK 轮转又慢又危险&quot;——前者只在子区内部传播，后者要穿越父区的委托，任何一处不同步都会在父区 DS 与子区 DNSKEY 之间撕开一道 Bogus 窗口。双签窗口的具体流程见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../zone-signing-key-ops/zone-signing-prepublication-rollover\">KSK/ZSK 预发布轮转与回滚窗口</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类典型轮转失败模式与其-ede-指纹\">四类典型轮转失败模式与其 EDE 指纹</h2><p>把上面的规则落到可观测现象，轮转失败基本收敛为四类，每一类都有稳定的 EDE 指纹。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，DS/DNSKEY 时序错位。</strong> 撤旧 DS 太早或新 DNSKEY 发布太晚，解析器拿到一条指向不存在公钥的 DS，验签失败，EDE <strong>9（DNSKEY Missing）</strong>，退一步是通用 <strong>6（DNSSEC Bogus）</strong>。这类失败<strong>按签名者名字聚集</strong>，是识别&quot;某区在改配置&quot;最直接的信号。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，签名过期或尚未生效。</strong> 重签计划没跟上验证窗口，出现 EDE <strong>7（Signature Expired）</strong> 或 <strong>8（Signature Not Yet Valid）</strong>；两者同时出现几乎必然是签发器时钟漂移。RFC 1982 的 32 位串行算术窗口意味着时钟回拨几个月的验证器会同时判过期与未生效。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，算法降级为静默 Insecure。</strong> 这是唯一&quot;不报错&quot;的一类：AD 命中率阶跃下降而非 SERVFAIL 上升。定位手段不是看错误日志，而是<strong>对 AD 位采样</strong>——把 AD 置位的应答占比做成时间序列，算法轮转的失误会在这里显示为一次不会被 EDE 记录的塌陷。</p>\n<p><strong>其四，算法炸弹与资源耗尽。</strong> CVE-2023-50387（KeyTrap，2024-02 公开）利用同一 key tag 下多把密钥、多条 RRSIG 的组合把单次验证的 CPU 复杂度推到极端，影响 Unbound、BIND、Knot Resolver、PowerDNS 等主流实现。它的修复方向是<strong>限制单次验证尝试的签名/密钥数量</strong>，与&quot;算法支持面&quot;是同一枚硬币的两面：验证器的资源边界也是攻击面。</p>\n<p>此外还有一类容易被忽略的<strong>key tag 冲突</strong>：RFC 4034 附录 B 的 key tag 是 16 位摘要，两把不同的 KSK 撞 tag 时，父区 DS 无法区分它们，轮转会出现&quot;DS 明明更新了却验不过&quot;。发布新密钥前必须先算 tag 并确认与在用密钥不冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障定位路径-从-ede-码倒推钥与签名\">故障定位路径：从 EDE 码倒推钥与签名</h2><p>排障应从信息码出发、逐层收窄，而不是从&quot;打不开网站&quot;出发。定位链路与 EDE 各码的语义紧密对应，EDE 的完整码表与缓存语义见 <a href=\"validation-pipeline-negative-caching-ede\">校验流水线、负缓存策略与 EDE 扩展诊断码</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[投诉: 域名解析异常] --&gt; E{应答里有 EDE 吗?}&#10;  E --&gt;|无 EDE| N[先在解析器侧确认是否验签&lt;br/&gt;dig +dnssec 看 AD 位]&#10;  E --&gt;|EDE 1 或 2| ALG[算法/摘要不受支持&lt;br/&gt;升级验证器或改回兼容算法]&#10;  E --&gt;|EDE 7 或 8| SIG[签名时效问题&lt;br/&gt;查签发器时钟与重签计划]&#10;  E --&gt;|EDE 9| DK[DS 指向的公钥缺失&lt;br/&gt;查父区 DS 与子区 DNSKEY 同步]&#10;  E --&gt;|EDE 6 单独出现| G6[通用 Bogus&lt;br/&gt;用 delv/dnsviz 复现到具体 RRset]&#10;  E --&gt;|EDE 27| N3[NSEC3 迭代过高&lt;br/&gt;权威侧降到 0 次]&#10;  ALG --&gt; R[确认是否同时影响 AD 命中率]&#10;  SIG --&gt; R&#10;  DK --&gt; R&#10;  G6 --&gt; R&#10;  N3 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; FIX[修复后先看 AD 命中率回升再撤监控]\">flowchart TD\n  S[投诉: 域名解析异常] --&gt; E{应答里有 EDE 吗?}\n  E --&gt;|无 EDE| N[先在解析器侧确认是否验签&lt;br/&gt;dig +dnssec 看 AD 位]\n  E --&gt;|EDE 1 或 2| ALG[算法/摘要不受支持&lt;br/&gt;升级验证器或改回兼容算法]\n  E --&gt;|EDE 7 或 8| SIG[签名时效问题&lt;br/&gt;查签发器时钟与重签计划]\n  E --&gt;|EDE 9| DK[DS 指向的公钥缺失&lt;br/&gt;查父区 DS 与子区 DNSKEY 同步]\n  E --&gt;|EDE 6 单独出现| G6[通用 Bogus&lt;br/&gt;用 delv/dnsviz 复现到具体 RRset]\n  E --&gt;|EDE 27| N3[NSEC3 迭代过高&lt;br/&gt;权威侧降到 0 次]\n  ALG --&gt; R[确认是否同时影响 AD 命中率]\n  SIG --&gt; R\n  DK --&gt; R\n  G6 --&gt; R\n  N3 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; FIX[修复后先看 AD 命中率回升再撤监控]</pre><p>工具选择按&quot;能不能给出中间状态&quot;排序：<code>delv</code>（BIND 自带）会打印每一步的信任链与失败原因，比 <code>dig +dnssec</code> 单看 AD 位信息量大得多；<code>drill -S</code>（ldns）、<code>unbound-host</code> 类似；外部诊断器 DNSViz、Zonemaster、Verisign DNSSEC Debugger 则从&quot;若我是验证器&quot;的视角重放整条链，适合判断是权威侧数据问题还是本地解析器版本问题。判定顺序建议固定为<strong>先确认 AD 位、再看 EDE 码、最后才看 SERVFAIL 计数</strong>——因为静默 Insecure 只会出现在第一项，而后两项对它完全无感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化与演练-把轮转从手工仪式变成可回滚流程\">自动化与演练：把轮转从手工仪式变成可回滚流程</h2><p>轮转的可靠性来自&quot;变化可被下游察觉&quot;，RFC 7344 与 RFC 8078 定义了两条自动化信道：子区发布 <strong>CDS</strong> 记录宣告&quot;这是我的新 DS&quot;，发布 <strong>CDNSKEY</strong> 宣告&quot;这是我的新公钥&quot;，父区（或注册商）据此自动更新委派。它把 RFC 7583 的时序常数从&quot;人工排期&quot;变成&quot;由发布驱动&quot;，代价是父区必须真的支持这些记录——许多 TLD 仍只接受人工 DS 提交，此时的自动化只是单侧的。</p>\n<p>剩下两件事靠工程纪律。<strong>其一是校验型解析器的演进管理</strong>：把网络里在用的解析器版本与 RFC 8624 支持面做成清单，任何一次算法升级前先确认没有落在旧版本上——否则升级动作本身制造静默降级。<strong>其二是演练</strong>：在非关键子区上完整走一遍&quot;发布新算法 → 双签 → 更新 DS → 撤旧算法&quot;，采样 AD 命中率与 EDE 分布，把轮转引入的失败与基线分开计数。AD 位与 EDE 的采样点是解析器侧同一个埋点，这也是 <a href=\"validating-resolver-role-trust-model\">校验型解析器角色与信任模型</a> 里强调&quot;AD 是出口结论&quot;的运维含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>解析器侧的算法与轮转工程可以压缩成三条纪律。<strong>算法协商先于密钥匹配</strong>：DS 侧的全不支持是静默 Insecure（RFC 6840 §5.2），DNSKEY/摘要侧的不支持才是可见的 EDE 1/2，两者必须分开设防；算法轮转只能走&quot;新旧并存&quot;。<strong>时序常数由 TTL 封顶</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>pub</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>DNSKEY</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{pub}} = D_{\\text{prp}} + TTL_{\\text{DNSKEY}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DNSKEY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>DS</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{obs}} = D_{\\text{prp}} + TTL_{\\text{DS}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，KSK 比 ZSK 多的正是 DS 那一跳，签名有效期必须覆盖叠加窗口。<strong>定位从 AD 位与 EDE 出发</strong>：EDE 7/8 指向时效、9 指向 DS/DNSKEY 错位、1/2 指向版本、27 指向 NSEC3 参数，而最危险的降级只能靠 AD 命中率的时间序列捕获。底线是：<strong>不报错的失败才是真正的失败</strong>，监控必须盯着 AD 位，而不只是 SERVFAIL 计数。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"解析器算法支持、密钥轮转失败模式与故障定位","id":"解析器算法支持-密钥轮转失败模式与故障定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"算法协商先于密钥匹配：降级语义的三种出口","id":"算法协商先于密钥匹配-降级语义的三种出口"},{"level":2,"text":"验证器的算法支持面：注册表与 RFC 8624 分级","id":"验证器的算法支持面-注册表与-rfc-8624-分级"},{"level":2,"text":"密钥轮转的时序模型：常数错了就会漏签","id":"密钥轮转的时序模型-常数错了就会漏签"},{"level":2,"text":"四类典型轮转失败模式与其 EDE 指纹","id":"四类典型轮转失败模式与其-ede-指纹"},{"level":2,"text":"故障定位路径：从 EDE 码倒推钥与签名","id":"故障定位路径-从-ede-码倒推钥与签名"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化与演练：把轮转从手工仪式变成可回滚流程","id":"自动化与演练-把轮转从手工仪式变成可回滚流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"校验流水线、负缓存策略与 EDE 扩展诊断码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/resolver-validation-recursive/validation-pipeline-negative-caching-ede"},"next":{"title":"在线/离线签名平台架构与选型模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/deployment-monitoring-rollout/signing-architecture-online-offline"}}